+## Installation and save data
+NEXORA uses a new Android package ID and installs alongside the previous Lucky Pull app. The previous app and its local save remain untouched unless you manually uninstall that older app. NEXORA starts a fresh local save under its own Android app storage; it does not automatically import the previous app's progress.
 
 ## Safety
 The game uses virtual rewards only. It has no cash prizes, betting, paid pass, or real-money wagering. All core progression is local and offline.
